  <section>
    <h2>Three Ways In</h2>
    {% texy %}
      01) **System Health Audit**
            Your system, its delivery pipeline and its cloud costs reviewed. A concrete report: what breaks, what leaks money, what to fix first — ranked by impact. Use it as a brief for your team or for us. No obligation to continue.

      02) **Optimization Sprint**
            One sprint, one system, one problem — fixed price. A legacy takeover, a slow pipeline, a runaway bill, a performance wall: diagnosed, fixed and documented in 10 working days, with a measured before/after.

      03) **Managed Operations**
            When the sprint proves it, we run it: recurring maintenance, monitoring and cost optimization of the systems we've built. You hand over the loop; we return uptime, reports and lower bills.
    {% endtexy %}
